  {
   "id": 535568,
   "is_answer_order_important": true,
   "stimulus_html": "<figure>\n<img src=\"exercises/media/59426b56f77885fc.jpg\" alt=\"\">\n(credit: modification of work by Baldo B.A., Pham N.H./<i>Drug Allergy</i>)\n</figure>",
   "stem_html": "<p>This graph shows how well the lungs function result in an allergic patient following exposure to an allergen.</p>\n<p>What is a likely claim that can be done based on this graph?</p>",
   "answers": [
    {
     "id": 1048568,
     "content_html": "Lung function suffers an immediate decrease and then gradually recovers."
    },
    {
     "id": 1048569,
     "content_html": "Lung function suffers a gradual decrease in the next 20 hours."
    },
    {
     "id": 1048570,
     "content_html": "Lung function suffers an immediate decrease, recovers and then suffers a secondary, more serious decrease some hours later."
    },
    {
     "id": 1048571,
     "content_html": "Lung function suffers an immediate decrease, recovers and then suffers a secondary, less serious decrease some hours later."
    }
   ],
